Package: tind-archive-keyring
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: apt, gpgv
Installed-Size: 64
Description: Tind update repository: signing key and apt source
 Adds the Tind package repository (https://apt.servr.no/) to apt, with the key that signs it, so the
 tind-* packages update like everything else. The key fingerprint is
 0F04 FB12 B3F9 7F21 F377 2F7F FE16 2F9E 34C4 D769.
 .
 Channels: "stable" (the default; a package version arrives 14 days after it first appeared on
 "next"), "next" (immediately) and "test" (next plus a test branch's packages, for Morten's test
 machine). Switch with: sudo tind-channel next|stable|test.
 Updates install silently through unattended-upgrades.
